Anything small enough will go over a boulder: throw darts or rocks at it
until you get the "You kill it!" message. Spells or wands will also work,
but *not* force bolt or striking, because those will break the boulder
(all a wand of striking does is cast a force bolt, after all). Magic
missile, drain life, fire, cold, lightning, you name it.

To get rocks, go back to the level with the Sokoban entrance, and don't
break a boulder on any Sokoban level,

